---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="SMS Program | Chiropractic Grit"
  description="Public disclosure page for the Chiropractic Grit SMS program: sending number, message types, frequency, opt-in, opt-out (STOP), help (HELP), and privacy."
>
  <Nav />

  <main class="page">
    <div class="container">

      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="page-header">
        <div class="kicker">SMS Program</div>
        <h1>Chiropractic Grit SMS program.</h1>
        <p class="header-copy">
          This page describes the Chiropractic Grit SMS program: who sends, what gets
          sent, how often, the cost, how to opt out, and how to get help.
        </p>
        <p class="last-updated">Last updated: May 7, 2026</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="legal-content">

        <section>
          <h2>Sender</h2>
          <p>
            Messages on this program are sent by <strong>Chiropractic Grit LLC</strong>
            from the number <strong>(719) 654-1843</strong>. Save this number to your
            contacts as "Chiropractic Grit" so messages are easy to recognize.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>What you'll receive</h2>
          <p>
            Chiropractic Grit sends SMS messages to its users — chiropractors and
            practice staff who have opted in — for these purposes:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Waitlist updates and early-access invitations</li>
            <li>Onboarding and account-setup instructions</li>
            <li>Trial-status, billing, and subscription notifications</li>
            <li>Platform status notices (downtime, campaign-registration updates)</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            Messages are <strong>not</strong> sent to patients of any chiropractic
            practice through this program.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>How often</h2>
          <p>
            Message frequency varies, typically up to four messages per month per
            recipient.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Cost</h2>
          <p>
            <strong>Msg &amp; data rates may apply.</strong> Chiropractic Grit does not
            charge users for SMS messages, but your mobile carrier's standard messaging
            rates apply.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>How to opt in</h2>
          <p>You can opt in to the Chiropractic Grit SMS program in any of these ways:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Check the SMS consent box on the <a href="/waitlist">waitlist form</a></li>
            <li>Check the SMS consent box during practice onboarding inside the Chiropractic Grit application</li>
            <li>Enable SMS notifications in your account settings</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            Each opt-in is recorded with a timestamp, the consent method, and the phone
            number you provided.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>How to opt out (STOP)</h2>
          <p>You can stop receiving SMS messages at any time by:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Replying <strong>STOP</strong> to any message from <strong>(719) 654-1843</strong></li>
            <li>Replying STOPALL, UNSUBSCRIBE, CANCEL, END, or QUIT — all are honored</li>
            <li>Disabling SMS in your account settings</li>
            <li>Emailing <a href="mailto:support@chiropracticgrit.com">support@chiropracticgrit.com</a></li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            After you opt out, you will receive a single confirmation message and no
            further texts will be sent.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Help (HELP)</h2>
          <p>
            Reply <strong>HELP</strong> to any message from <strong>(719) 654-1843</strong>
            for assistance, or email
            <a href="mailto:support@chiropracticgrit.com">support@chiropracticgrit.com</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Privacy</h2>
          <p>
            Chiropractic Grit will <strong>not</strong> sell or share your phone number
            with third parties for marketing purposes. SMS messages are delivered by
            Telnyx under a data-protection agreement.
          </p>
          <p>
            For full details, see our
            <a href="/sms-terms">SMS Terms &amp; Privacy</a>,
            <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>, and
            <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding: 52px 0 84px;
  }

  .page-header {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-bottom: 52px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .kicker {
    color: var(--ember);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.5vw, 3.6rem);
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .header-copy {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 62ch;
  }

  .last-updated {
    color: var(--subtle);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .legal-content {
    max-width: 740px;
  }

  section {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    padding-bottom: 40px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  section:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.97rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }

  p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  li::before {
    content: '';
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--ember);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  a {
    color: var(--ember);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  a:hover {
    color: var(--ember-strong);
  }

  strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .page {
      padding: 36px 0 64px;
    }

    section {
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      padding-bottom: 28px;
    }
  }
</style>
